---
config:
  layout: elk
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant API as HTTP Layer
    participant Context as Request Context
    participant UC as Bookkeeping Use Case
    participant Currency as Currency / Exchange Rate
    participant Bookkeeping as Bookkeeping Service
    participant Repo as Journal Entry Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Handler

    User->>API: Submit transfer journal entry
    API->>Context: Initialize user, correlation ID, accounting entity
    API->>UC: Execute record-transfer use case
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over UC,Currency: Application orchestration
        UC->>UC: Validate payload
        UC->>Context: Read accounting entity and user
        UC->>Currency: Resolve functional currency and exchange rates
        Currency-->>UC: Return currency and exchange rates
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over UC,Bookkeeping: Domain recording
        UC->>Bookkeeping: Record balanced transaction
        Bookkeeping-->>UC: Return journal entries and domain events
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 235)
        Note over UC,Repo: Database persistence
        UC->>Repo: Save journal entries
        Repo-->>UC: Save successful
    end

    UC-)EventBus: Publish enriched domain events
    UC-->>API: Complete
    API-->>User: Success response
